          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi muyaayi wa Jese yamiha ku Isiraeli yoosi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ku mihiga 40. Yamiha mu Heburoni ku mihiga 7, na mu Jerusalemi ku mihiga 33 na tatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwami Daudi yakuza naveeye mundu muhindira ligali, mundu wu vutugi vwivwe, kandi ni lizominywa lilie lilahi. Mwana muyaayi weve Solomoni yavugula ovogono vwivwe kuli mwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Makuva ga kale gu mwami Daudi kutura mu litanga kuduuka ku keheri, gang'odwa mu kitabu cha makuva ga vaporofeti vavaga: Samweli, Nazani na Gadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 29:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Makuva gang'odwa yaga gavoora kuli mwami Daudi yamiha, kuli yaali ni zinguru zizie, kandi vindu viosi viakoleka kuye, nu ku Isiraeli, kandi ku vwami vundi vwosi vwe vivala vindi!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.29.30"
            ]
          }
        }
